Package: fmisc
Title: Miscellaneous R Utilities
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Fabian", "Distler", , "fdistlermpi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Miscellaneous utilities for software development in R:
    composable function decorators for retry, timing, logging, caching
    and rate limiting; memory-aware chunked processing with RAM
    monitoring and disk spillover; OS-aware parallel apply helpers;
    a 'stop2()' error helper; and package-development templates.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/fabiandistler/fmisc, https://fabiandistler.github.io/fmisc/
BugReports: https://github.com/fabiandistler/fmisc/issues
